deno_core 0.411.0: embed extension sources; errno on Android and iOS.

1. extensions.rs: include_js_files! and include_lazy_loaded_js_files! record
   each extension source by its absolute build-machine path and read it only
   while a snapshot is being made. This build boots without a snapshot (QuickJS
   cannot load a V8 one), so the runtime would read those paths on the device
   and fail with "Failed to initialize a JsRuntime: No such file or directory".
   Switch both to `included`, which embeds the files with include_str!.

2. uv_compat/tty.rs reads errno through a per-platform extern and has a
   compile_error!() for every OS but macOS and Linux. iOS uses Darwin's
   __error(); Android's bionic exposes __errno().

